From: gta4xl Linux bring-up <linux@gta4xl.local>
Subject: [PATCH] mm: allow selecting built-in zsmalloc for modular zram

The gta4xl configuration builds zram as a module and its allocator into the
kernel. Give ZSMALLOC a prompt so Kconfig honors CONFIG_ZSMALLOC=y from the
configuration fragment rather than reducing it to zram's selected value m.

--- a/mm/Kconfig
+++ b/mm/Kconfig
@@ -123,7 +123,7 @@ config ZSWAP_COMPRESSOR_DEFAULT
        default ""
 
 config ZSMALLOC
-	tristate
+	tristate "Zsmalloc allocator"
 
 menu "Zsmalloc allocator options"
 	depends on ZSMALLOC
